# The build context of both images is the repository root (docker-compose.yaml uses context
# ../.., src/docker-compose.yml uses .., deploy-roofcontroller-rpi.sh passes the repo root).
# Docker only reads .dockerignore from the context root, so it lives here and serves both:
#
# - src/HVO.RoofControllerV4.RPi/Dockerfile (the controller) needs Directory.Build.props,
#   Directory.Packages.props, src/global.json, src/NuGet.config and the Common, RPi and
#   WebSite.Themes project folders under src/.
# - src/HVO.RoofControllerV4.Emulator/Dockerfile (the HAT emulator) needs the same root files
#   and the Common, Simulation and Emulator project folders under src/.
#
# Do not exclude any of those.

# VCS, CI and editor metadata
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.devcontainer
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.DS_Store

# Build output (host bin/obj must never overwrite the container's restore/publish output)
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/coverage.json
**/coverage.xml
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg

# Projects and folders neither image builds
tests
docs
src/HVO.RoofController.sln

# Local secrets, certificates and environment files: never send them to a builder
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets
**/secrets.*
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt

# Container and deployment definitions (not needed inside the image)
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/*.sh

# Miscellaneous
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
LICENSE
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
